# A series read, cold and then warm. The first pump reads the pre-sample
# snapshot ([LSER.8.6.1]), which is null ([LSER.19.8]) and reaches the slot as
# `-1.0`; the second and third read a warm mean. `Report.avg` is a payload
# slot, so the recording comparison carries the value.
assert Thermometer entity_id=kitchen temperature=20.0
pump
assert Thermometer entity_id=kitchen temperature=30.0
pump
assert Thermometer entity_id=kitchen temperature=40.0
pump
